{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01144","headline":"相和歌辞 铜雀妓 · 刘商","name":"相和歌辞 铜雀妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魏主矜蛾眉，美人美於玉。\n高台无昼夜，歌舞竟未足。\n盛色如转圜，夕阳落深谷。\n仍令身殁後，尚足平生慾。\n红粉横泪痕，调弦空向屋。\n举头君不在，唯见西陵木。\n玉辇岂再来，娇鬟爲谁绿。\n那堪秋风里，更舞阳春曲。\n曲终情不胜，阑干向西哭。\n台边生野草，来去罥罗縠。\n况复陵寝间，双双见麋鹿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}